From 7673c59d76acf5e14b22490fae2eb8ff14907c2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yunyun Cao <yunyunc@codeaurora.org>
Date: Fri, 27 Apr 2018 10:24:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] weston/compositor-sdm: weston light weight feature

sdm and gl renderer take too much time to do initialization. Add
light weight temporary work mode for weston to meet customer's KPI
requirement.

Change-Id: I78fe1a00b3e7df5c4c7aa0d6e1d8cfafed298e49
Signed-off-by: Yunyun Cao <yunyunc@codeaurora.org>
